{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"On Sunday I still drank from the fountain, then went to the beautiful Clary Park, then took a bath, then went once more to the slag heap to finally take in the charming view, — then got into the carriage at 11 o'clock, — first over the second of the mountain ranges mentioned above, — everything fertile, rich, varied, — hills full of fields, meadow valleys, villages, fruit trees; after the mountain had been crossed in about 1 ½ hours, it goes from now on downhill or level (except for some small elevations) to Prague, — from the height of the mountain, into this other plane, an unbounded view to Lowositz, just as varied and rich, — from here flat country, boring fruit fields, — twice over the Eger — the second time with the most beautiful reflections of the moonlight towards Meldros. — Today through equally boring country, until the point where I suddenly looked down into the Moldau valley and onto Prague, — indeed a pleasant view shrouded in fragrance — and arrived there at 11 o'clock. — So I am writing this in Prague, and here there are immediately two interesting points: the one is Uncle, the other a letter from you, which needs to be seen and asked about"}}],"created":1795220716,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":265,"prompt_tokens":381,"total_tokens":646,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-JiufHxrH785pP7maj9CpQewLJtWZ3rGs","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":381,"prompt_ms":477.058,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.2521207349081365,"prompt_per_second":798.6450284871023,"predicted_n":265,"predicted_ms":6122.341,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.190685606060608,"predicted_per_second":43.12076050647946}}